.SH NAME
anpu-plugin - Extend ANPU with YAML checks and Go plugins


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBanpu plugin [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Run user-supplied detections through ANPU's guarded fetching.

.PP
Plugins never touch the network directly: every request goes through
the same SSRF, local-network, timeout, and redirect guards as built-in
engines. See docs/plugins.md for the SDK contract and examples.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for plugin


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to a YAML config file (default: anpu.yaml in the current directory, if present)

.PP
\fB--data-dir\fP=""
	data directory for the scan-history DB and caches (default: os.UserConfigDir()/anpu; override with the ANPU_HOME environment variable)

.PP
\fB--verbose\fP[=false]
	show per-stage finding and warning counts


